66b","yululu-q-edc8054917fdddf07307","yululu-q-17029a3cf3c64ac4f343","yululu-q-b9eaedb6a4bf107d23e9"],"facts":[{"id":"zhonghua-f2-27fd743b9be47abb11be","text":"王朗以通经拜郎中，除菑丘长；师太尉杨赐，杨赐薨后弃官行服；举孝廉、公府辟，皆不应。","evidence":["zhonghua-q2-57d62f14437041eee7b5"]},{"id":"zhonghua-f2-ac02873f47854f1960ac","text":"魏国初建，王朗以军祭酒领魏郡太守，迁少府、奉常、大理。","evidence":["zhonghua-q2-7ab397a34f352417bf25"]},{"id":"zhonghua-f2-4ad10de49ebbbbc96155","text":"王朗迁御史大夫，封安陵亭侯。","evidence":["zhonghua-q2-183dc120d0fbb69683c7"]},{"id":"zhonghua-f2-44ee0deb6e923309e9d5","text":"文帝践阼，王朗改司空，进封乐平乡侯。","evidence":["zhonghua-q2-375a5ad72553c01479cc"]},{"id":"zhonghua-f2-1b23172f2a6287958a8b","text":"明帝即位，王朗进封兰陵侯，增邑五百、并前千二百户。","evidence":["zhonghua-q2-0e53de69e5b93143a73d"]},{"id":"zhonghua-f2-328383dd340c85cae8b0","text":"王朗转司徒。","evidence":["zhonghua-q2-0cc72ae300c57078029b"]},{"id":"zhonghua-f2-d267e89fe6febf75785e","text":"王朗著《易》《春秋》《孝经》《周官》传及奏议论记。","evidence":["zhonghua-q2-5fe6fc12107ccb1f100d"]},{"id":"zhonghua-f2-777353b9d5e520450250","text":"文帝分王朗户邑拟封一子列侯，王朗乞封兄子详。","evidence":["zhonghua-q-25f397c0c1ad5364961d"]},{"id":"zhonghua-f2-18884b09c5c091d80638","text":"本篇记王朗本名严，后改为朗。","evidence":["zhonghua-q2-8cc5f87f56ff1f261f54"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-p112-wudi-p0309","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p112"]},{"id":"wendi-m-o003-wudi-p0309","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-o003"]},{"id":"wendi-m-p059-wudi-p0309","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-p059"]},{"id":"wendi-m-p062-wudi-p0309","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-p062"]},{"id":"wendi-m-p098-wudi-p0309","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-p098"]},{"id":"wendi-m-p104-wudi-p0309","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-p104"]},{"id":"mingdi-m-o003-wudi-p0309","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["mingdi-q-o003"]},{"id":"mingdi-m-o012-wudi-p0309","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["mingdi-q-o012"]},{"id":"shaodi-m-o020-wudi-p0309","